---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Security — RBAC · CSP · Audit" description="FileStore locking, CORS allowlist, audit JSONL, HSTS preload — copy Foaster hardening for a free-hosted static site.">
  <section class="bg-[var(--ls-cream)] py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="ls-inner max-w-[880px]">
      <h1 class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem)]">Security</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] max-w-[60ch]">Marketing site = static, no DB, no session. Dashboard (separate origin) is the only authenticated surface — see <code class="font-mono text-[0.82rem]">src/ai_company/security/rbac.py:126</code> + <code class="font-mono text-[0.82rem]">src/ai_company/dashboard/app.py:54</code>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="ls-shell max-w-[880px] space-y-6 py-8">
    <div class="rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-6">
      <h2 class="font-semibold">Headers (shipped on every edge response)</h2>
      <pre class="mt-3 bg-[var(--ls-pearl)] border border-[var(--ls-divider)] rounded-[12px] p-4 font-mono text-[0.74rem] overflow-auto">Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
X-Frame-Options: DENY  |  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://app.cal.com; … frame-ancestors 'none'
Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()</pre>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">On Vercel via <code class="font-mono">vercel.json</code> headers; on Cloudflare Pages via <code class="font-mono">public/_headers</code>. GitHub Pages fronted by Cloudflare for HSTS.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-[16px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-6">
      <h2 class="font-semibold">Threats & mitigations</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[0.92rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] list-disc pl-5">
        <li><strong>XSS/supply-chain:</strong> static only, no innerHTML from URL, pinned deps, SRI for CDN, <code class="font-mono">npm audit</code> in CI.</li>
        <li><strong>Form spam:</strong> hosted forms (Formspree/Tally) + honeypot + Turnstile + 5/min/IP rate limit at edge.</li>
        <li><strong>Secrets:</strong> <code class="font-mono">.env</code> gitignored, <code class="font-mono">detect-private-key</code> + <code class="font-mono">gitleaks</code>, rotate 90d per <code>docs/DASHBOARD_KEY_ROTATION.md</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>Domain takeover:</strong> register before CNAME, CAA <code>letsencrypt.org</code>, delete DNS on decommission, monitor <code>securityheaders.com</code>.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-[16px] bg-[var(--ls-pearl)] border border-[var(--ls-divider)] p-6 text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">
      Disclosure: <a href="mailto:security@lightspeedholdings.com" class="underline">security@lightspeedholdings.com</a> · <a href="/.well-known/security.txt" class="underline">security.txt</a> · Last audit 2026-08-26.
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
